  <reporting-org ref="XM-DAC-41301" type="40">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Food and Agriculture Organization (FAO)</narrative>
  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building Effective Resilience for Gender Equality and Women Empowerment in the Caribbean</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To increase gender balance for equal and effective access to agricultural, fisheries and small business extension services and agricultural (and small agri-fisheries) support programmes 

To increase gender balance for small holder farmers and entrepreneurs along the value chain, including access to new and/or facilitated finance, financial services and low cost insurance products make them accessible to farmers, fisher folk and small business entrepreneurs

To increase gender balance for access to land, and to land and business title registration as well as supporting gender sensitization in public policy which affect small scale farming, fisheries and related small businesses</narrative>
  </description>
